    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Greetings! I am a Ph.D student in &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.imo.universite-paris-saclay.fr/&#34;&gt;Laboratoire de Mathématiques d’Orsay &lt;/a&gt;, supervised by &lt;a href=&#34;https://sites.google.com/site/olivierschiffmann/home&#34;&gt;Olivier Schiffmann&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;I am interested in geometric representation theory and its interaction with mathematical physics (eg. quantum groups), automorphic forms (eg. geometric Langlands) and enumerative geometry (eg. DT-theory). &lt;br&gt;&#xA;I can be reached at prenom[.]nom[at]universite-paris-saclay[.]fr&lt;/p&gt;</description>
